{"schema":"php2shell-master-details-v1","source_head_sha":"bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2","type":"DECISION","count":24,"items":[{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-001","id":"P2S-DEC-001","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-22","label":"Créer un dépôt public `Php2shell` dans l'organisation `chainsolutions-wealthtech`, avec laboratoire fictif et outils défensifs","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-001.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-002","id":"P2S-DEC-002","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-22","label":"Construire l'agent suivant un cycle analyse → vulnérabilités prouvées → proposition de patch → tests → validations","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-002.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-003","id":"P2S-DEC-003","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Respecter intégralement le plan **V0.1 → V0.2 → V0.3 → V0.4 → V1.0**, sans suppression ni régression","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-003.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-004","id":"P2S-DEC-004","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Conserver **les deux sous-domaines sur S1** : PHP2SHELL pour l'analyse, PHPPATCH pour la remédiation","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-004.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-005","id":"P2S-DEC-005","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Architecture cible avec **conteneurs Docker isolés**, GitHub/MCP existants et déploiement gouverné","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-005.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-006","id":"P2S-DEC-006","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Maintenir les 5 capacités fondamentales : analyse PHP ; avis CVE officiels ; génération patch ; tests de patch ; interface Web","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-006.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-007","id":"P2S-DEC-007","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Exiger une **traçabilité durable** des conversations de travail, décisions, travaux, preuves, objectifs, blocages et reprise depuis toute nouvelle conversation","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-007.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-008","id":"P2S-DEC-008","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Éviter Codex/Copilot, les régressions, la fusion des autorités MCP/GRT, les écritures directes sur `main` et les opérations non autorisées","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-008.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-009","id":"P2S-DEC-009","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Confirmer **l'intégralité de la mission fondatrice** : campagnes de centaines/milliers de domaines, CSV/JSON/TXT, identification PHP passive, code autorisé, CVE/intelligence, patch/validation, supervision et rapports","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-009.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-010","id":"P2S-DEC-010","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Les **six lots historiques** et les cinq versions V0.1→V1.0 sont **deux vues complémentaires** d'un même programme","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-010.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-011","id":"P2S-DEC-011","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Les CVE-2026-109618 et CVE-2026-109619 ainsi que les correctifs amont sont **documentés par le projet PHP et le CERT-FR** ; leur applicabilité à chaque actif n'est pas attestée par la CLI actuelle","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-011.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-012","id":"P2S-DEC-012","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-27","label":"Ajouter à PHP2SHELL un **audit de site déclenché par URL dans le frontend**, parcours et analyse des pages autorisées, diagnostic PHP/CVE et document de remédiation ; permettre dans PHPPATCH le correctif proposé, les tests et la validation séparée","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-012.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-013","id":"P2S-DEC-013","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-28","label":"Organiser **toutes les prochaines actions identifiables** dans un workflow continu, **multidirectionnel et intelligent**, en préservant la priorité actuelle et la reprise inter-conversations","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-013.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-014","id":"P2S-DEC-014","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-28","label":"Autoriser la poursuite technique continue sans nouvelle confirmation pour les opérations admissibles ; utiliser `Patricked-code` pour les revues GitHub si nécessaire","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-014.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-015","id":"P2S-DEC-015","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":"2026-10-28","label":"Durcir le prototype FastAPI local par une borne **réelle** d'octets ASGI (4096), indépendamment de l'en-tête `Content-Length`","source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-015.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-016","id":"P2S-DEC-016","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":null,"label":null,"source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-016.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-017","id":"P2S-DEC-017","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":null,"label":null,"source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-017.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-018","id":"P2S-DEC-018","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":null,"label":null,"source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-018.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-019","id":"P2S-DEC-019","type":"DECISION","date_utc_or_period":null,"label":null,"source":"https://github.com/chainsolutions-wealthtech/Php2shell/blob/bed7c218d71743c4175b6b95f43a788105f966a2/history/decisions/P2S-DEC-019.md","evidence":"REPORTED_IN_CANONICAL_LOG"},{"key":"DECISION:P2S-DEC-020